"""The agent: an LLM in a loop with tools, wrapped in deterministic code that keeps it safe.

    user -> Orchestrator -> ChatModel (LLM decides: answer, or call tools)
                         -> McpToolbox -> MCP server -> REST API

The model proposes; the orchestrator disposes. Code, not the prompt, enforces:
  * identity: account tools only run after verify_member succeeds, always for that member;
  * confirmation: write tools never run until the member says yes to a description generated by code;
  * idempotency: each confirmed action carries a key, so retries cannot apply it twice;
  * a step budget, after which the conversation is handed to a human;
  * a redacted trace of every step, for debugging and evaluation.
"""
